# SP-3 | BrowseComp+ pilot, 100 questions (50 the stored 0.8747 GPT-5 run got wrong + 50 it got right; studies/search_policy/
#   experiments/inputs/pilot100_ids.txt) | Document REPL agent | GPT-5 (high requested) | Reason-ModernColBERT 8192 (:8766) behind
#   the search-policy proxy (novelty + Qwen3-Reranker-4B over the top 30) on :8772
# Reference: BCP-23 (the stored GPT-5 ColBERT-8192 runs; no fresh control: the 10-question control in logs/bcp_gpt5_rr/ctrl
#   was stopped and is not used). Comparison point for "fixed / broken": VAR-2.
# model: Azure deployment AZURE_DEPLOYMENT_GPT5 (original: a personal deployment name) serving gpt-5; served_models: null
# effort requested: high (root and sub; record config reasoning_effort / sub_reasoning_effort "high"). Effort actually sent:
#   NONE -- the launcher loads only the retry429 hook, so rlm's Azure client drops reasoning_effort (KNOWN_ISSUES K3); the
#   deployment default applied. BCP-23 ran on a patched rlm build whose effort handling is UNKNOWN (K5), so the two
#   efforts may differ.
# caps: --max-searches 10, --max-iterations 30 (+1 forced final answer), --default-k 5 (k model-chosen), --max-timeout 2700,
#   xargs timeout 3300 (record config: prompt_id 94f31e91f6b7, retrieval_server :8772, max_timeout_s 2700)
# proxy: POLICY=novelty+rerank, UPSTREAM :8766, DEPTH 30 (default), RERANK_MEM_FRACTION=0.5, RERANK_TOK_BUDGET=8000, GPU 0;
#   the first start (22:31) ran out of GPU memory and was discarded (SP-I14).
# run: 2026-10-26 22:35 with 6 workers, restarted 22:49 with 4 workers (run_rr.log); 100 records, done 10-27 01:53.
# judge: gpt-4.1 (logs/bcp_rejudge_gpt41/pilot_rr.json); superseded: gpt-4o (logs/bcp_gpt5_rr/_judge_cache_gpt4o.json).
# original output: <original repo>/logs/bcp_gpt5_rr/rr
ROW_ID=SP-3
BENCHMARK=browsecomp_plus
ENTRY=src/run_one.py
LAUNCHER="studies/search_policy/experiments/sp3_bcp_gpt5_rerank_pilot.sh (starts the proxy, then experiments/bcp_gpt5_colbert.sh)"
REFERENCE=BCP-23
IDS_FILE=studies/search_policy/experiments/inputs/pilot100_ids.txt
ROOT_MODEL=gpt-5
SUB_MODEL=gpt-5
DEP='${AZURE_DEPLOYMENT_GPT5}'
REASONING_EFFORT=high
SUB_REASONING_EFFORT=high
EFFORT_SENT=none
RETRIEVER="Reason-ModernColBERT PLAID 8192 (:8766) behind the rerank proxy :8772"
SERVER=http://127.0.0.1:8772
POLICY=novelty+rerank
DEPTH=30
RERANK_MODEL=Qwen/Qwen3-Reranker-4B
RERANK_MEM_FRACTION=0.5
RERANK_TOK_BUDGET=8000
MAX_SEARCHES=10
MAX_ITERATIONS=30
MAX_TIMEOUT=2700
WORKERS="6, then 4 (restart 22:49)"
EFFORT=high
RUN_ARGS='--design B --server http://127.0.0.1:8772 --root-model gpt-5 --sub-model gpt-5 --root-deployment ${DEP} --sub-deployment ${DEP} --reasoning-effort high --sub-reasoning-effort high --default-k 5 --max-iterations 30 --max-searches 10 --seed-context --compaction --grounding-gate --lean-prologue --no-delegation --solo-prompt --no-orchestrator --compaction-threshold-pct 0.85 --max-concurrent-subcalls 4 --max-timeout 2700'
ENV_SET='AZURE_OPENAI_API_VERSION=2024-12-01-preview AZURE_OPENAI_DEPLOYMENT=${DEP} PYTHONPATH=<hooks>/retry429:<RLMLIB_PATH>'
ENV_UNSET='QUERIES_FILE SUP_FENCE_TOLERANT SUP_MAX_BLOCKS SUP_PRESENCE_PENALTY BM25_CORPUS'
ORIGINAL_OUTPUT="<original repo>/logs/bcp_gpt5_rr/rr"
